        "summary": "χmT of 2 decreases from 29.87 emu mol−1 K at 300 K to 7.99 emu mol−1 K at 1.8 K, below the uncorrelated MnIII2TmIII4 value, indicating antiferromagnetic interactions and/or TmIII orbital angular momentum. Curie–Weiss parameters are C = 32.45 emu mol−1 K and θ = −27.75 K. Magnetization reaches 11.32 Nβ at 1.8 K and 5 T. No out-of-phase ac signals were observed above 1.8 K.",
